repository-code: "TODO"
abstract: >-
  Uncertainty-aware proactive self-healing for mobile edge IoT systems.
  Evaluates action-conditioned counterfactual futures before intervening,
  executes the cheapest action satisfying a calibrated risk bound, abstains
  when none does, and validates counterfactual rankings by deterministic
  fork-and-replay of a distributed emulation testbed.
